bass   | r/8           | r/8           | eb2/4@60 eb2@70 | bb1/4@80 bb1@95 |
chords | r/8           | r/8           | r/2 [eb4,g4,bb4]'@50 r [eb4,g4,bb4]'@65 | r/2 [bb3,d4,ab4]'@80 r [bb3,d4,ab4]'@100 |
